WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:04.935
Patient intake should be easy for patients and easier to manage for your team.

00:04.935 --> 00:11.030
VisitConnect guides patients through their request, while bringing the details together for staff.

00:11.030 --> 00:14.652
Let's follow the workflow using fictional information.

00:15.462 --> 00:19.215
Patients choose a language and follow the steps on screen.

00:19.215 --> 00:22.758
They select a service and an eligible provider.

00:22.758 --> 00:26.135
The next step shows sample appointment times.

00:26.135 --> 00:29.447
Patients choose a requested time and continue.

00:29.447 --> 00:35.297
In this demonstration, the request still needs staff review before an appointment is booked.

00:36.104 --> 00:38.697
Patients choose a coverage option.

00:38.697 --> 00:41.455
Here, we select self-pay.

00:41.455 --> 00:45.385
They then complete their questionnaires in the same guided flow.

00:45.385 --> 00:53.336
The questions cover visit goals and health history, medications and allergies, and contact or accessibility needs.

00:53.336 --> 00:58.014
Patients can answer none, unsure, or prefer not to answer.

00:58.014 --> 01:01.828
Their responses are collected digitally for staff review.

01:02.650 --> 01:06.712
Patients review their consent and type their full name to sign.

01:06.712 --> 01:09.830
The signature covers the reviewed answers.

01:09.830 --> 01:13.593
If an answer changes, they review and sign again.

01:13.593 --> 01:17.859
Before sending, they can check the details on the Review screen.

01:17.859 --> 01:21.106
Their request then appears in the staff queue.

01:21.106 --> 01:24.753
The practice follows up to confirm the next steps.

01:25.572 --> 01:28.513
Staff open the request from one queue.

01:28.513 --> 01:35.510
Patient details, questionnaire answers, consent and the signature record are together, ready to review.

01:35.510 --> 01:41.928
This is designed to reduce the time spent gathering intake paperwork and piecing together separate forms.

01:42.734 --> 01:46.358
Staff select Download signed forms PDF.

01:46.358 --> 01:51.036
The saved details and signed forms are packaged into one document.

01:51.036 --> 01:56.499
Staff can review the answers, consent and signature record in that PDF.

01:56.499 --> 02:00.481
They save the file and manually attach it to their EMR.

02:00.481 --> 02:06.744
This supports a simpler handoff, with live EMR integration still requiring implementation.

02:07.552 --> 02:11.446
Staff can add an internal note to record the next step.

02:11.446 --> 02:15.802
They move the request to In review so the team can see its status.

02:15.802 --> 02:21.949
The workflow keeps the follow-up organized without sending a patient message or writing to an EMR.

02:22.770 --> 02:27.128
For patients, clear steps to complete and sign their forms.

02:27.128 --> 02:32.541
For the practice, one place to review the details and one PDF to download.

02:32.541 --> 02:38.546
VisitConnect is designed to simplify patient intake and reduce paperwork handling for your team.

02:38.546 --> 02:43.713
Request a walkthrough from BAMS Technology and see how it could fit your office.

02:43.713 --> 02:48.997
This product demonstration uses fictional information and sample availability.

02:48.997 --> 02:52.257
Live EMR integration is not connected.
